{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 bosses (4 in the full version plus the final boss)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock relics as starter items (full version also allows to unlock Masteries)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite playtime. Survive as much as you can!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full Adventure in 20 Minutes </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat huge amounts of mobs while walking around a tiny open world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Roguelike short fast-paced adventures mixing sword and magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your power by combining passives and spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit different party members with different perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 80 unique passives, 30 unique spells. More passives in the full game!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sort the order of relics and spells to take advantage of different synergies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy villages, loot them and cause all around mayhem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699880/extras/DestructionHA_5_-_5.gif?t=1747426119\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A tiny open world with biomes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the north pole and the desert by just jogging around for a few minutes and defeat their guardians</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat cute and strong bosses</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699880?t=1747426119","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699880?t=1747426119","capsule_ima